  "description": "<p>When a client is allowed to perform acl:Append operations on an LDP-RS<br/>\n1) a PATCH request that deletes triples must be denied with a 401 (Unauthorized code)<br/>\n2)  PATCH request that only adds triples should be allowed.</p>\n\n<p>An acl:Append operation applies when the acl governing a particular LDP-RS contains a \"&lt;&gt; acl:mode acl:Append\" triple.</p>\n\n<p>c.f. <a href=\"https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#append-ldprs\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#append-ldprs</a>  :  5.7.1</p>",
